1
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:11,804
Choose a few dependencies.
Inherit many more.

2
00:00:12,254 --> 00:00:21,246
Real lockfile: the yargs repository
28 direct dependencies, 562 installed

3
00:00:21,696 --> 00:00:35,176
Large graphs reveal progressively.
Search still reaches every package.

4
00:00:35,626 --> 00:00:42,510
is-number: a small utility
nobody here chose directly

5
00:00:42,960 --> 00:00:49,533
Assume it is compromised.
Its dependents light up.

6
00:00:49,983 --> 00:01:01,395
12 dependents, 10 hops from the root.
All development-only.

7
00:01:01,845 --> 00:01:12,676
Known advisories are real OSV records,
shown separately from the simulation.

8
00:01:13,126 --> 00:01:30,005
Trace exposure from an advisory,
then export JSON, Markdown, or PNG.

9
00:01:30,455 --> 00:01:41,243
Lockfiles stay in your browser.
Only names and versions are looked up.

